  "item.blacksouls.skill_book_dodo_run": "技能书【渡渡快跑】",
  "item.blacksouls.skill_book_dodo_run.lore.1": "使用后习得技能：渡渡快跑",
  "item.blacksouls.skill_book_dodo_run.lore.2": "吾辈是真的，真的，没有觉得寂寞哦……？",
  "item.blacksouls.skill_book_dodo_run.lore.3": "所，所以呢，请你不要再悲伤了……",
  "item.blacksouls.skill_book_dodo_run.lore.4": "我啊，§4最喜欢§7你了……",
  "item.blacksouls.skill_book_dodo_run.lore.5": "就算转个三圈也不会忘掉你的……",

  "item.blacksouls.skill_book_soul_arrow": "魔书【魂之矢】",
