  "entity.blacksouls.rabbit_knight.name": "兔骑士巴纳伊",
  "item.blacksouls.rabbit_knight_ev011_spawn_egg": "兔骑士巴纳伊（Map053 EV011）召唤",
  "dialogue.blacksouls.rabbit_knight.intro_1": "「………」",
  "dialogue.blacksouls.rabbit_knight.intro_2": "「您是不死者吧。而且不仅仅是普通的不死者，我能感受到强大的意志」",
  "dialogue.blacksouls.rabbit_knight.intro_3": "「您可有什么梦想么？……嘛，虽然我对这没什么兴趣」",
  "dialogue.blacksouls.rabbit_knight.intro_4": "「我终于……终于……终于还是离开了故乡。可不能一直在这种地方停留千代乃至八千代」",
  "dialogue.blacksouls.rabbit_knight.repeat": "「……我的梦想才刚刚开始」",
  "dialogue.blacksouls.rabbit_knight.alice_1": "「谁知道呢……我是不知道」",
  "dialogue.blacksouls.rabbit_knight.alice_2": "「但是有的时候，",
  "dialogue.blacksouls.rabbit_knight.alice_3": "比起思虑良多再去行动，什么都不要想，只管前进，",
  "dialogue.blacksouls.rabbit_knight.alice_4": "会比较好哟」",
  "dialogue.blacksouls.rabbit_knight.alice_5": "「……我也不能保证这句话一定对就是了。",
  "dialogue.blacksouls.rabbit_knight.alice_6": "总之不要盲目地相信别人说的话」",
